              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Keapuut apaarasia akanykaarei aŋetakin, koanyut lyudayan lukepote koAsia ŋes koyekalu, kisidikoto ekodet kere, kikamutu ŋes, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.21.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
