            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Konye napedwar kes aitolomar ŋes orekec, kiŋit Paul ekapolon ebe, “Ibus kereka eoŋ alimokin jo akirot?” Kobala ŋesi ebe, “Ijeni tope ijo Ayonanin? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
