            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Koboŋok Paul ebe, “Arai eoŋ Eyudayat, loko Taruso kotoma Kilikia, lokore lomere loedit; keŋaiŋait, kisiikinai kener kituŋa kalu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.21.39",
